  "code" : "public boolean isCyclic(int v, List<List<Integer>> adj) {\n    int[] indegree = new int[v];\n    for (int node = 0; node < v; node++) {\n        for (int next : adj.get(node)) indegree[next]++;\n    }\n\n    Queue<Integer> queue = new LinkedList<>();\n    for (int i = 0; i < v; i++) {\n        if (indegree[i] == 0) queue.add(i);\n    }\n\n    int processed = 0;\n    while (!queue.isEmpty()) {\n        int node = queue.poll();\n        processed++;\n        for (int next : adj.get(node)) {\n            indegree[next]--;\n            if (indegree[next] == 0) {\n                queue.add(next);\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    return processed < v;\n}",
